           :description "Apache Preflight PDF/A validation APIs for .NET, mechanically translated by DripSharp. This package is an independent translation and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the Apache Software Foundation."
           :authors "Isak Sky"
           :copyright "Portions Copyright The Apache Software Foundation and other upstream contributors; see NOTICE.txt."
